From: ovis-tui <ovis-tui@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:59:37 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] feat(embed): refuse input typed while a wire recovers, on
 request

With Embed::discard_input_on_recovery, keys, pastes and mouse input that arrive while a pane's wire is down, reopening after a loss, or reopened and not yet painted are refused with the usual notice instead of queued for the recovered wire. The default keeps today's queueing.
